THIRD-PARTY LICENSES — RUST COMPONENTS

The following Rust crates make up the dependency graph of Zephyr's
shipped builds (desktop and mobile, all platforms), generated with
cargo about from the workspace lockfile. Part A reproduces each distinct
license text gathered from the crates, including the copyright notices
it carries; several crates can share one text. Part B maps each crate to
its license(s).

